cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AutoDocker in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "AutoDocker"
abstract: >-
  AutoDocker is a containerized virtual-screening pipeline that prepares
  proteins (chain selection, fpocket pocket detection, receptor PDBQT),
  prepares ligands (local files or PubChem downloads), docks with AutoDock
  Vina (QuickVina 2 and SMINA options), and produces reproducible ranked
  reports including an HTML report (on by default) with an embedded NGL 3D viewer.
keywords:
  - molecular docking
  - virtual screening
  - AutoDock Vina
  - OpenBabel
  - fpocket
  - drug discovery
  - reproducibility
license: MIT
version: "2.0.0"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22035568
